@host = http://localhost:5001

### GET — начальное значение RESULT = 0
GET {{host}}/stack

### POST — установить RESULT = 10
POST {{host}}/stack
Content-Type: application/json

{ "RESULT": 10 }

### PUT — push 5  (RESULT = 10 + 5)
PUT {{host}}/stack?ADD=5

### PUT — push 7  (RESULT = 10 + 7)
PUT {{host}}/stack?ADD=7

### GET — RESULT = 17
GET {{host}}/stack

### DELETE — pop 7  (RESULT = 10 + 5)
DELETE {{host}}/stack

### DELETE — pop 5  (RESULT = 10)
DELETE {{host}}/stack

### DELETE — стек пуст -> 409
DELETE {{host}}/stack

### Другой клиент (без cookie сессии) — своя пустая сессия, RESULT = 0
# @no-cookie-jar
GET {{host}}/stack
